If active, the status is set automatically set to Credit Hold, if the Total Open Balance (including Vendor activities)  is higher then the Credit Limit. It is set to Credit Watch, if above 90% of the Credit Limit and Credit OK otherwise.', 90, 'Y', NULL, NULL, 'N', NULL, 'Y');
