(2) The record is referenced by other records. E.g., you cannot delete a Business Partner, if there are invoices for this partner record existing. You de-activate the Business Partner and prevent that this record is used for future entries.', 260, 'Y', NULL, NULL, 'N', NULL, 'Y');
